        <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Data</h1>
        <p class="govuk-body">You can get the data for all products and services as an Excel export from COMPASS.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">
            <a class="govuk-link" href="https://compass.education.gov.uk/modern/manage/fips/dashboard" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Download the Excel export from the COMPASS dashboard<span class="govuk-visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
        </p>
        <p class="govuk-body">You can also use the developer options to access the service register data via an API. You can set this up yourself from the developer docs.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">
            <a class="govuk-link" href="https://compass.education.gov.uk/docs/api" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">COMPASS API developer docs<span class="govuk-visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
        </p>
